# TestNG discovers listeners on the classpath through this file (ServiceLoader).
#
# Registering here rather than in each suite XML means a new suite file gets retries,
# evidence capture and reporting automatically - there is no way to add a suite and
# forget the listeners, which is how reporting silently degrades over time.
com.adarsh.listeners.RetryTransformer
com.adarsh.listeners.TestListener
